MID_MV13_04: <SH>
MID_MV13_04_m001: Those ungrateful wretches!
MID_MV13_04_m002: "Sullied"?! "Betrayal"?! What putrid insects!
MID_MV13_04_m003: Such mockery! What right do they have\nto speak that way about our people?!
MID_MV13_04_m004: They know nothing, NOTHING of Yu Phas!
MID_MV13_04_m005: (punching exerts)
MID_MV13_04_m006: Hey, so uh, Bona? We can both agree\nthat the boss is getting worse, right?
MID_MV13_04_m007: Is she really so angry that this is\nthe only way for her to let it out?
MID_MV13_04_m008: Well, she did show great restraint earlier.
MID_MV13_04_m009: Yeah, I don't think that was "great." She may be getting\nby, but it's been downhill since her coronation.
MID_MV13_04_m010: You think it started with her\ngetting that arm from Mahadu?
MID_MV13_04_m011: If she gets any worse...there\nmight be no holding her back.
MID_MV13_04_m012: (shout of rage)
MID_MV13_04_m013: (panting)